WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.133
-Our next guest can be seen
in the Netflix

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.667
stand-up series
"Verified Stand-Up,"

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.501
premiering November 28th.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.400
Making her TV debut,

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.200
please welcome
the very funny Leslie Liao!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.033
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:19.868
-Hello!

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:22.367
Yes. Ooh, yes. Hello.

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:25.200
It's so good to be --
It feels so good to be here.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.300
Sorry. I feel like I sound
like I'm always flirting.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.200
Sorry. It's because my voice
is so deep and sensual.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.801
Do you hear that?
Do you like that?

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:35.934
Sorry. Sorry.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:38.100
I have had this voice
for most of my life.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.267
It's been a problem.

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:43.167
Like, I got this voice
at puberty.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:48.067
This was me on the playground
trying to make friends.

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:49.067
Okay?

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:50.234
I'd be like, "Hey, Britney,

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.734
want to have a sleepover
at my place tonight?"

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:55.567
She's like, "What the..."

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:57.534
"Me, you -- tickle fight?
Let's go. Tickle fight?"

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:58.868
She's like, "Oh, my God."

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.801
I grew up in Orange County,
California,

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:08.133
so for most of my life,
I identified as a white person.

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.801
It's good to see you all.

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:15.300
But I started to speak
like a white person,

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.167
even though I was living
my Asian-American experience.

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:20.934
Like, "I'd go up to all the
skater kids after school like,

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:23.467
"Sup? Anyone want to cruise
over to Kumon,

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:25.534
or, Jansen, you in?

00:01:25.534 --> 00:01:27.400
What's more rad
than school after school?

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.701
Let's go, dudes."

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:33.834
This is very confusing, okay?
I'm so ashamed.

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:35.734
I can't write my own name
in Mandarin,

00:01:35.734 --> 00:01:40.167
but I can draw the Stussy symbol
with my eyes closed.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:43.801
To this day, I can do it, okay?

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:47.868
I'm doing well, though.
I'm a single woman in my 30s.

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:50.534
[ Cheers and applause ]
I'm happy. Thank you.

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:53.133
Thank you for the support
for my time in need.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.067
Thank you.

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:57.734
But you know, in my 20s,
I used to be sad

00:01:57.734 --> 00:01:59.100
about being single.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.734
It used to bum me out.
You know, it made me very sad.

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:04.767
And now I've grown.
I've matured.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.300
Like, my feelings have evolved.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.501
Like, now I'm angry.

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:12.667
Now mama's pissed.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:14.567
I don't want to keep
looking for this man.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:17.501
I want to go home, okay?

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.267
When I find him,
I'm going to be like a mom

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:22.334
whose kid got lost
at the grocery store.

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:26.100
Like, "Where have you been?
Get in the car!

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:29.534
That was so embarrassing.
Stop crying.

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:31.000
I'll give you something
to cry about."

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.133
You know?

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:35.501
That's love.

00:02:35.501 --> 00:02:39.100
I do like a man
that cries, actually.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.567
I'm attracted
to a man who's vulnerable,

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:44.067
someone who's comfortable
sharing his emotions,

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.567
the dark parts of his life.

00:02:45.567 --> 00:02:48.267
That's sexy. That turns me on.

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:52.000
So, my dirty talk sounds
different these days.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.868
You know, back then,
I wanted you to talk about me.

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:57.167
Now I want to hear about you.

00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:59.734
Like, whisper naughty things
in my ear,

00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:03.267
like, how many games
did your dad miss?

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:07.734
Ooh! Ooh! The entire season?
How does that make you feel?

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:10.534
Mmm!

00:03:10.534 --> 00:03:12.868
Like, look, I'm not going to
open up until you open up.

00:03:12.868 --> 00:03:16.400
Do you know what I mean?
Wink, wink.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.901
You got...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:17.901 --> 00:03:22.100
That's how it works now.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.267
You got it?

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:26.300
But I'm realistic now
in my dating life.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.701
Like, I finally accepted this.

00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:31.901
I'm probably not going
to find my "dream man."

00:03:31.901 --> 00:03:33.000
And it's fine.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.634
I had way too many things
on the checklist

00:03:34.634 --> 00:03:35.701
for this perfect person.

00:03:35.701 --> 00:03:37.234
It's not realistic.

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:39.501
You know, you got to let things
go off the checklist.

00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:42.701
It's just like house hunting.

00:03:42.701 --> 00:03:45.701
You're not going to get all your
must-haves in one place, right?

00:03:45.701 --> 00:03:47.067
You got to sacrifice something.

00:03:47.067 --> 00:03:50.834
It's either location or size.
Do you know what I mean?

00:03:50.834 --> 00:03:52.567
If it's big, I'm going
to drive far for it.

00:03:52.567 --> 00:03:55.601
If it's big. Do you get it?

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.868
You got to be
realistic now, okay?

00:03:57.868 --> 00:03:58.968
You're going to end up
in a place

00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:02.734
with a lot of
wear and tear, right?

00:04:02.734 --> 00:04:06.300
And you're going to meet
this "house" and be like,

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:11.033
"What did the previous owner
do to this place?

00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:14.334
What kind of damage
do I got to live with?

00:04:14.334 --> 00:04:17.901
This place is a mess."
Okay?

00:04:17.901 --> 00:04:20.501
But it's a struggle for me
being a straight woman.

00:04:20.501 --> 00:04:22.667
I really --
I have trouble with it.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:26.067
I rarely find a man
that gets me smitten right away.

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:27.200
It's hard to explain.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:32.467
Like, I'm straight,
so I'm attracted to men,

00:04:32.467 --> 00:04:37.367
but I don't find men attractive.

00:04:37.367 --> 00:04:38.834
Do you know what I mean?

00:04:38.834 --> 00:04:42.267
[ Cheers and applause ]
You seem to understand.

00:04:42.267 --> 00:04:46.868
Yeah. It's like,
"I want you to hold me,

00:04:46.868 --> 00:04:50.968
but do you always
have to wear a hat?"

00:04:50.968 --> 00:04:54.133
I'm sorry.
Do you know what I mean?

00:04:54.133 --> 00:04:56.968
You're in my eyeline. I'm sorry.
You know?

00:04:56.968 --> 00:04:59.734
Look, no offense.

00:04:59.734 --> 00:05:02.534
I don't get why I'm straight.
I don't understand it.

00:05:02.534 --> 00:05:04.267
Women are gorgeous.

00:05:04.267 --> 00:05:07.367
Like, any woman -- beautiful.
Look -- beautiful.

00:05:07.367 --> 00:05:10.801
Any woman could walk by
and take your breath away.

00:05:10.801 --> 00:05:16.200
But I have never seen
some floating hat in a crowd

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.834
and time stopped.

00:05:17.834 --> 00:05:22.200
I've never, never been like,
"Oh, my, my, my!"

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:26.801
Like never -- Like,
"Who is that man in those

00:05:26.801 --> 00:05:28.901
Costco basketball shorts?

00:05:28.901 --> 00:05:31.467
Yummy!"

00:05:31.467 --> 00:05:33.601
Okay, I've said enough.
I'm Leslie Liao.

00:05:33.601 --> 00:05:37.033
Sorry. Thank you so much.
Thank you, thank you.

00:05:37.033 --> 00:05:38.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:42.968
-Fantastic! Leslie Liao!

00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:47.601
"Verified Stand-Up" is streaming
November 28th on Netflix.

00:05:47.601 --> 00:05:49.634
Leslie Liao! We'll be
right back, everybody.

